        "```markdown\n",
        "## K-Means Model Fitting & Interpretation\n",
        "Based on Elbow Curve and Silhouette Scores, we will select an optimal $k=4$ to balance grouping quality with clear clinical utility. Let's fit our final model, assign patients to clusters, visualize the profiles, and save the model objects.\n",
        "```"
      ]
